&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Welcome&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;DKB&amp;nbsp;AG….&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;excited to share that our hiring process is now led by Code Factory (CoFa), DKB’s sister tech company, bringing a more agile and collaborative approach to building our cross-functional teams. While&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;go through the hiring journey with&amp;nbsp;CoFa, your employment will be with DKB, combining the stability of a leading bank with the speed and innovation of a tech-driven environment. Join us to be part of a team where collaboration and impact come first.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;{ {&amp;nbsp;…&amp;nbsp;a_place_to_stay_curious:&amp;nbsp;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technology is a key driver of our continued growth. With modern architecture, a high-performance cloud infrastructure, and a robust data and AI foundation, we are constantly evolving our platform—serving as the foundation for new digital products and services. Our standards are high: security, reliability, and the responsible use of AI are integral components of every solution from the very beginning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;} } ;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 4&quot;&gt;{&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 4&quot;&gt;your_responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 4&quot;&gt;: [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:319,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:319}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and operate our AWS-based cloud platform with a focus on stability, scalability and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and optimize our Kubernetes/EKS environment, including namespaces, RBAC, ResourceQuotas and NetworkPolicies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reusable CI/CD components, especially with GitLab CI/CD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design GitOps-based deployment processes using Flux, Helm and Kustomize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate infrastructure and AWS resources with Terraform and Crossplane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage secrets and sensitive configuration securely, for example with SOPS and AWS KMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve monitoring, alerting and observability with Prometheus, Grafana and OpenSearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and resolve issues across CI/CD, Kubernetes, GitOps and cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable development and project teams to manage deployments, platform usage and CI/CD processes independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;} ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;{ following_qualifications_would_be_in_line_with_our_desired_profile_for_this_position: [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in DevOps, platform engineering, cloud infrastructure or SRE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good hands-on knowledge of AWS, especially EKS, IAM/IRSA, S3, KMS, RDS/Aurora and networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience with Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD, ideally GitLab CI/CD and reusable pipeline templates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of GitOps principles and tools such as Flux, Helm or Kustomize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with Infrastructure as Code, especially Terraform and/or Crossplane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of monitoring, observability, alerting and performance optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoyment of creating standards, sharing knowledge and enabling product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, independent and solution-oriented working style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communication in &lt;strong&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally at &lt;strong&gt;C1 level or above&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;} ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;{ nice_to_have: [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated environments, audit requirements or controlled release processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with on-call, incident response, runbooks or post-incident improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications such as CKA, AWS Solutions Architect Associate or comparable credentials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 4&quot;&gt;] } ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:319,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:319}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;match every single requirement?&amp;nbsp;No&amp;nbsp;worries! We encourage you to apply anyways, even if your qualifications do not align perfectly. You might still be just the right candidate for us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;{ {&amp;nbsp;…how_to_start_your_career_at_DKB:&amp;nbsp;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We want you to feel good about working with us, to feel valued, and to be able to contribute fully.&amp;nbsp;You can find out what makes us tick and whether DKB is the right employer for you even before you apply&amp;nbsp;by following&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dkb.de/karriere/arbeitgeber#unternehmenskultur&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;this link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;}&amp;nbsp;} ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.dkbcodefactory.com/images/benefits_dkbag.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By the way: At our company, every person matters. We embrace fairness and diversity—no matter where you’re from, how old you are, or your sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, or religion, whether you have a disability or not—we genuinely look forward to every application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A career driven by you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our global community.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join our Platform Engineering team at AutoScout24 Group. We build the internal platform that 600+ developers rely on to ship software quickly and safely: centralized Kubernetes, managed CI/CD, project templates, and the developer tooling that runs on top of AWS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Our customers are developers.&lt;/strong&gt; We live &quot;you build it, you run it&quot; and we invest in self-service and a product mindset so a small team can have a big impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A big part of that today is &lt;strong&gt;making developers more productive with AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;re already deep in it. We&#39;ve driven AI tooling adoption across the company and we&#39;re building out the platform behind it: secure managed environments for AI coding tools, AI-assisted CI (automated PR reviews, fixes for failing builds), agentic workflows on AWS (Bedrock, Agent Core), and MCP-based integrations. The AI is the means, not the end. What we care about is a faster, smoother day-to-day for every engineer, and AI is the biggest lever we have.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a senior platform engineer who already works fluently with modern AI tooling and uses it to move fast. You reach for Claude, Codex, and agents to get real work shipped, and you&#39;d rather build something and learn from it than research it forever. You bring solid infrastructure and AWS fundamentals, product thinking, and the communication skills to own a topic, plan it, and bring people with you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate the internal AI platform: secure AI coding environments, AI in CI/CD, agentic workflows on AWS (Bedrock / Agent Core), and reusable building blocks teams adopt by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own products end to end. You design, build, run, and improve them with a product mindset, treating fellow engineers as your customers and shaping interfaces that are genuinely easy to build with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start from the developer&#39;s day. You figure out where the real friction is, decide what would actually make their work easier, and measure whether people adopt it once it ships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of a topic, plan the work, drive it to done, and keep stakeholders in the loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the bar for how we build with AI. You turn an interesting idea into tooling people can actually rely on, and you bring the rest of the team along with you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape architecture and technology choices for our platform foundations (Kubernetes, CI/CD, IaC on AWS) and for the AI capabilities on top, and say what you think in technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the platform reliable, secure, observable, and cost-aware. You&#39;ll join the on-call rotation and help troubleshoot production incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture reusable patterns, templates, and blueprints so the whole organization moves faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-level experience (typically 5+ years) building and operating infrastructure or platform products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on GenAI experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve built with LLM APIs, tool/function calling, retrieval, agents, or agent frameworks and put them into real workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern AI coding tools (e.g. Claude Code, Codex) are part of how you work day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong AWS fundamentals and a genuine appreciation for Infrastructure as Code and Pipeline as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real feel for developer experience. You can look at a feature and tell whether it&#39;ll make a developer&#39;s life easier or just add another thing to learn, because you&#39;ve lived that friction yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration. You work well in a team, share your opinions clearly, and can move a topic forward with people across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid engineering fundamentals: testing, debugging, code quality, and getting things ready for production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SRE / DevOps principles and observability concepts (CloudWatch, Datadog, OpsGenie or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You code well in at least one language, ideally Python, Go, or TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for shipping. You&#39;re comfortable taking something ambiguous and turning it into a working solution with sensible scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this team...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Platform Engineering sits at the center of how the company builds software, and the AI platform is the bet we&#39;re most excited about right now. You&#39;ll get real ownership, teammates who are already invested in AI, and the room to define how the whole organization builds with it. We use the tools we build.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At AutoScout24 we celebrate diversity as a strength. Our organization comprises 50+ nationalities working together inclusively and respectfully. If you want to shape how an entire engineering organization builds with AI, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As an Engineering Manager, you will lead a team within one domain, building a high-performing environment that solves user problems and delivers measurable business value. You will combine people leadership with technical judgement, partner closely with Product and UX, and take accountability for delivery and the systems your team owns.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role spans people, delivery, technology, financials and business. You will understand the current position in each area and focus on the priorities that matter most at a given time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Team leadership and development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, coach and develop a high-performing team. Identify capability gaps, break down knowledge silos, hire the right talent and support both top performers and people who need to improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment of trust, candid feedback, learning and psychological safety. Monitor morale and wellbeing, address productivity blockers and handle difficult conversations when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations, support individual growth paths and hold people accountable for commitments. Delegate effectively, balancing autonomy, guidance and learning, and empower the team to make decisions aligned with company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain management decisions clearly, challenge constructively and commit to agreed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Delivery and collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own team capacity, work in progress, output and engineering outcomes. Partner with Product and UX on feasible roadmaps, milestones and capacity allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and review technical initiatives, technical debt reduction and operational work. Define engineering excellence metrics, assess cost and value, contribute to design documents and refine effort estimates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate proactively with stakeholders and other teams. Resolve blockers through alternative solutions with clear ownership and timelines, or escalate when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognise when business problems could benefit from machine learning and align initiative planning with data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security and regulatory compliance for the systems your team owns, including timely remediation or formal risk acknowledgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technology and operational excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand your team’s services, architecture and data flows. Guide technical decisions, review design options for resilience, cost and performance, explain trade-offs and contribute hands-on when time allows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply threat modelling, secure design principles and mandatory security training. Avoid accidental complexity and use established practices, platform capabilities and AutoScout24 engineering values and principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure actionable monitoring and alerting. Define and refine service level objectives with stakeholders, review reliability and performance, and act when objectives are missed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where on-call is required, establish sustainable rotations, shared knowledge and incident practice. Follow incident and security escalation processes, conduct post-incident reviews and complete improvement actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make business data available through the data platform, maintain its metadata and take responsibility for its quality, availability and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Financials and business impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor infrastructure and licence costs, plan mitigating actions and involve the group director and Finance when needed. Support budget planning, follow procurement guidelines and align capitalisable product capacity with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align team priorities with company strategy and stakeholder needs. Negotiate trade-offs across timing, quality and scope to maximise value and learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the business impact of releases, use product metrics to inform recommendations and show how the team contributes to company goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cross-team initiatives by identifying improvements, defining and delivering tasks, and presenting outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry experience consistent with Engineering Manager scope, typically 8+ years, with the ability to lead and develop an engineering team within one domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with mobile engineering teams and a solid understanding of React Native, including its architecture, development practices and the challenges of building and maintaining high-quality cross-platform applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical judgement and understanding of software architecture, operational reliability, security and the systems your team owns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to coach, delegate, give direct feedback and manage challenging people and leadership situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning capacity, delivering engineering outcomes and working effectively with Product, UX, data teams and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of business metrics, financial trade-offs and fundamental data science concepts, combined with clear prioritisation and communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we&#39;re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we&#39;re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you&#39;ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.A culture of growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A career driven by you.&lt;/strong&gt; Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our global community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to lead the strategy, design, delivery, and operational excellence of integrations, automations, and enterprise platform initiatives across ERP, Billing, Revenue, CRM, HRIS systems. This role requires a strong technical and people leader with deep expertise in enterprise systems, data flows, platform modernization, migration programs, and large-scale delivery execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of enterprise integrations and automation solutions across ERP, Billing, Revenue, CRM, HRIS, and related platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define scalable integration patterns, system interfaces, API strategies, data flows, and engineering standards across enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply an AI-first approach to solution development by identifying opportunities to improve automation, operational efficiency, insights, and engineering productivity through AI-enabled capabilities where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure AI-enabled solutions are implemented responsibly, with appropriate governance, security, explainability, and alignment to business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system migration initiatives, including transition planning, cutover strategy, dependency mapping, risk management, and business continuity considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data archival and retention strategies, ensuring compliance, accessibility, cost efficiency, and operational integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system decommissioning efforts, including impact assessment, transition planning, historical data preservation, and retirement of legacy capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the design and support of data pipelines that enable reliable movement, transformation, and availability of business-critical data across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business reporting and analytical needs by ensuring enterprise data is trusted, well-structured, and accessible for decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end execution of integration and platform programs, including planning, prioritization, dependency management, issue resolution, and delivery oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce deployment, release, and rollback plans to ensure safe production changes, minimal disruption, and rapid recovery when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engineering resources by providing technical direction, coaching, mentorship, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business and technology stakeholders to translate complex requirements into practical, scalable, and maintainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices for documentation, monitoring, support readiness, operational governance, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions are secure, reliable, maintainable, and aligned with enterprise standards and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education, Experience &amp;amp; Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in software engineering, enterprise systems, integrations, or business systems technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant engineering management experience with strong ownership of team leadership, delivery execution, stakeholder alignment, and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing, troubleshooting, and supporting software systems such as Billing, Revenue, CRM, ERP, HRIS, and related enterprise platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad expertise in database technologies, including enterprise data modeling, transactional and analytical data structures, data storage, performance optimization, and data lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with scripting and automation technologies used to support integrations, operational processes, batch workloads, and platform support activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with reporting, analytics, and enterprise data consumption patterns, including the delivery of trusted data for operational and business insight needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of integration patterns, APIs, middleware, event-driven and service-based architectures, and enterprise automation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering and supporting real-time and batch integration solutions across a variety of enterprise technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with data pipelines, transformation processes, orchestration, and system-to-system synchronization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of software design principles and the ability to design systems at both conceptual and detailed levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern API technology stacks, including web services, service contracts, payload formats, authentication, and enterprise integration standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system migration, production releases, deployment planning, rollback strategies, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills with the ability to influence, negotiate, and align technology initiatives with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with technical experts across enterprise, digital, and business platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset with strong attention to detail and a high sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to structure teamwork, create clarity, and drive accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong conflict management, problem-solving, and resolution skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance strategic planning with hands-on delivery leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills across engineering, operations, data, product, and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated AI-first and innovation-oriented mindset, with the ability to evaluate emerging technologies pragmatically and apply them to real business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
